  "content": [
    {
      "text": "ye shall receive the greater damnation, Matt. 23:14 (Luke 20:47). vipers, how can ye escape the damnation of hell, Matt. 23:33. blaspheme … in danger of eternal damnation, Mark 3:29. these shall receive greater damnation, Mark 12:40. he that believeth not shall be damned, Mark 16:16 (Morm. 9:23; Ether 4:18; D&C 68:9; 112:29). unto the resurrection of damnation, John 5:29. whose damnation is just, Rom. 3:8. that resist shall receive to themselves damnation, Rom. 13:2. unworthily, eateth and drinketh damnation to himself, 1 Cor. 11:29 (3 Ne. 18:28–32). all might be damned who believed not the truth, 2 Thes. 2:12. damnation, because they have cast off their first faith, 1 Tim. 5:12. their damnation slumbereth not, 2 Pet. 2:3.",
